{
  "_comment": "Coverage matrix: form × button → test node-id substring patterns. The builder aggregates all matching tests into one cell outcome. Worst-of priority: FAIL > ERROR > SKIP > PASS > NOT_RUN (SKIP outranks PASS: a skipped test leaves an unverified path).",
