    "CmdGephi", "CmdUCINet", "CmdKML", "CmdGUESS", "CmdRun",
    "CmdUTF8Pajek"
  ],
  "na": {
    "_comment": "Buttons that do not exist on the form (no VBA handler). CmdKML has no handler on any form.",
